  "prefLabel": "He-W 544.03 Provider Participation",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-07-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 544.03 Provider Participation. Each participating hospice provider shall:\n\n(a) Be medicare certified as a hospice provider;\n\n(b) Be an NH enrolled medicaid provider;\n\n(c) Hold a current NH state license as a home hospice care provider or hospice house in accordance with RSA 151:2 and He-P 823 or He-P 824 or be licensed as such by the state in which they practice; and\n\n(d) Notify the department of a recipient’s discharge from the hospice provider within 5 business days of the discharge.\n\nSource. #9726-A, eff 7-1-10, EXPIRED 7-1-18\n\nNew. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-W 544) #13847, eff 1-6-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w500.html"
